---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Research – Hanh Tran"
  description="Selected publications of Hanh Tran in information extraction, terminology and named entity recognition."
  current="research"
  footer="compact"
>
<main style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; box-sizing: border-box">

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; padding: 40px 0 40px">
<h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.2vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.035em; font-weight: 600">Research</h1>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--body); max-width: 32em; text-wrap: pretty">Information extraction, terminology and named entities across languages and domains, and what large language models change about them. 20+ peer-reviewed papers, one Best Paper Award.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: var(--muted)">Listed here: journal articles and papers at conferences ranked CORE B or higher. <a href="https://scholar.google.com/citations?user=OGb4sloAAAAJ" style="font-weight: 500">Full list on Google Scholar ↗</a></p>
</section>

<section style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; border-top: 1px solid var(--ink)">

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="flex: 0 0 90px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 2px">2026</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">N. T. Nam, A. Jatowt, A. Hamdi, M. Coustaty, <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, and A. Doucet. 2026. <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Reference-free Evaluation at Inference for NER/NEL over OCRed Historical Texts.</strong> In <em>Proceedings of the Fifteenth Language Resources and Evaluation Conference (LREC 2026)</em>.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="flex: 0 0 90px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 2px">2025</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">M. Martinc, <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, S. Pollak, and B. Koloski. 2025. <a href="https://aclanthology.org/2025.findings-emnlp.764/" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">SEKE: Specialised Experts for Keyword Extraction.</a> In <em>Findings of the Association for Computational Linguistics: EMNLP 2025</em>, pages 14191–14205, Suzhou, China. Association for Computational Linguistics.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, M. Martinc, J. Caporusso, J. Delaunay, A. Doucet, and S. Pollak. 2025. <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Recent Advances in Automatic Term Extraction: A Comprehensive Survey.</strong> <em>ACM Computing Surveys</em>.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, C.-E. González-Gallardo, A. Doucet, and S. Pollak. 2025. <a href="https://univ-tours.hal.science/hal-05088938v1" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">LlamATE: Automated Terminology Extraction Using Large-scale Generative Language Models.</a> <em>Terminology</em>, 31(1):5–36.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">W. Sun, N. Girdhar, <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, C.-E. González-Gallardo, M. Coustaty, et al. 2025. <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Ar-Q-Former: Historical Newspaper Article Separation Based on Multimodal Transformer Structure.</strong> In <em>Document Analysis and Recognition – ICDAR 2025</em>, pages 476–492. Springer.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="flex: 0 0 90px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 2px">2024</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">C.-E. González-Gallardo, <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, A. Hamdi, and A. Doucet. 2024. <a href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-72437-4_22" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Leveraging Open Large Language Models for Historical Named Entity Recognition.</a> In <em>Linking Theory and Practice of Digital Libraries (TPDL 2024)</em>, Lecture Notes in Computer Science, vol. 15177, pages 379–395. Springer. <span style="color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600">Best Paper Award.</span></p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, M. Martinc, A. Repar, N. Ljubešić, A. Doucet, and S. Pollak. 2024. <a href="https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s10994-023-06506-7" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Can Cross-domain Term Extraction Benefit from Cross-lingual Transfer and Nested Term Labeling?</a> <em>Machine Learning</em>, 113(7):4285–4314.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">W. Sun, <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, C.-E. González-Gallardo, M. Coustaty, and A. Doucet. 2024. <a href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-72437-4_15" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">LIAS: Layout Information-Based Article Separation in Historical Newspapers.</a> In <em>Linking Theory and Practice of Digital Libraries (TPDL 2024)</em>, Lecture Notes in Computer Science, vol. 15177, pages 256–272. Springer.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">W. Sun, <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, C.-E. González-Gallardo, M. Coustaty, and A. Doucet. 2024. <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">LIT: Label-Informed Transformers on Token-Based Classification.</strong> In <em>Linking Theory and Practice of Digital Libraries (TPDL 2024)</em>, Lecture Notes in Computer Science, vol. 15177, pages 144–158. Springer.</p>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">W. Sun, <strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, C.-E. González-Gallardo, M. Coustaty, and A. Doucet. 2024. <a href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-70546-5_15" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Global-SEG: Text Semantic Segmentation Based on Global Semantic Pair Relations.</a> In <em>Document Analysis and Recognition – ICDAR 2024</em>, Lecture Notes in Computer Science, vol. 14807, pages 253–269. Springer.</p>
</div>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 32px; padding: 24px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<h2 style="flex: 0 0 90px; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); padding-top: 2px">2022</h2>
<div style="flex: 999 1 420px; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px">
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty"><strong style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">H. T. H. Tran</strong>, M. Martinc, A. Doucet, and S. Pollak. 2022. <a href="https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-18840-4_26" style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink)">Can Cross-domain Term Extraction Benefit from Cross-lingual Transfer?</a> In <em>Discovery Science (DS 2022)</em>, Lecture Notes in Computer Science, vol. 13601, pages 363–378. Springer.</p>
</div>
</div>

</section>

<section style="padding: 40px 0 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(360px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 32px 56px">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">PhD thesis</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Neural Approaches to Automatic Terminology Extraction. Cotutelle between La Rochelle University and Jožef Stefan Institute, supervised by Prof. Antoine Doucet and Asst. Prof. Senja Pollak, 2021 – 2024.</p>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.25; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Academic service</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; color: var(--body); text-wrap: pretty">Programme committee member and reviewer for LREC, EMNLP, COLING, ECAI, ICPR and SemEval. PC member of TextGraphs-17 at ACL 2024 and Student Session Chair at ESSLLI 2024.</p>
</div>
</section>

</main>
</Layout>
